---
import LearningJourney from '../components/LearningJourney.astro';
import ProductPossibilities from '../components/ProductPossibilities.astro';
import LearningFounder from '../components/LearningFounder.astro';
import StarterOffer from '../components/StarterOffer.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const posts = (await getCollection('blog')).sort((a,b) => b.data.publishDate.valueOf()-a.data.publishDate.valueOf());
const featured = posts.filter(p => !/bank|tax|citizen|residen|offshore|passport|wyoming|uae|estonia|flags|asset-protection|nevis|incorporate|wise-vs/i.test(p.slug)).slice(0,3);
---
<Layout title="Learn — Strategic Sloth" description="A practical library for independent work. Explore free articles, creator tools, and digital books at your own pace.">
<section class="container learning-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE STRATEGIC SLOTH LEARNING LIBRARY</p><h1>Build something useful.<br/>Give it a way to sell.</h1><p class="lede">Practical books and tools for turning what you know into a digital product.<br/>Choose an idea, build the asset, and set up a simple way to sell it.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/start/#book-offer">Start with the $5 guide <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/samples/dont-do-anything/">Read a sample chapter <span>↗</span></a></div></div><aside class="library-art library-illustration" aria-label="Inside the library"><div class="library-illustration-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE KNOWLEDGE. PUT TO WORK.</span></div><img src="/studio-images/sloth-learning.webp" width="1000" height="1000" alt="Our sloth having a bright idea while reading, perched on a stack of books." fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/><p>Free reading. Practical tools.<br/>Books for going deeper.</p></aside></section>
<LearningJourney/><ProductPossibilities/><StarterOffer location="learn-entry"/><LearningFounder/><section class="section container" id="paths"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / CHOOSE A DIRECTION</p><h2>Start with a question.</h2></div><p>You don’t need a whole new plan.<br/>Just a useful next step.</p></div><div class="learning-grid">
<a class="learning-card" href="/start/"><span class="card-number">01 / GET STARTED</span><h3>What could I make?</h3><p>Find a specific problem, outline a small digital product, and test whether it helps someone.</p><span class="text-link">A beginner’s reading path →</span></a>
<a class="learning-card" href="/tools/"><span class="card-number">02 / PUT IT INTO PRACTICE</span><h3>Give an idea some shape.</h3><p>Use free planning tools to explore an angle, sketch an outline, and describe your offer.</p><span class="text-link">Open the creator tools →</span></a>
<a class="learning-card" href="/reading-guide/"><span class="card-number">03 / EXPLORE FURTHER</span><h3>Think beyond the project.</h3><p>The Freedom Library covers independent work, business structures, and international living.</p><span class="text-link">Explore the library →</span></a></div></section>
<section class="learning-shelf"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / GO A LITTLE DEEPER</p><h2>Two shelves.<br/>Different questions.</h2></div><p>Paid digital books, clearly explained.<br/>Choose the subject that fits your needs.</p></div><div class="shelf-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">CREATOR GUIDES / 15 BOOKS</span><h3>From idea to a useful product.</h3><p>Focused guides on making, packaging, and sharing digital products. Browse individual titles or compare three bundles.</p><a class="button" href="/books/">Browse creator books <span>↗</span></a></article><article><span class="eyebrow">FREEDOM LIBRARY / 11 BOOKS</span><h3>A wider view of independent work.</h3><p>Reading on life design, business structures, banking, residency, and citizenship. Three packages, with a clear list of what each includes.</p><a class="button" href="/reading-guide/">Explore the 11-book library <span>↗</span></a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / SOMETHING TO READ</p><h2>Open the notebook.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">All articles →</a></div><div class="learning-grid">{featured.map(post => <a class="learning-card article-card" href={`/blog/${post.slug}/`}><span class="card-number">FREE ARTICLE · {post.data.readTime} MIN READ</span><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.description}</p><span class="text-link">Read article →</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="container learning-faq" id="questions"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW USEFUL DETAILS</p><h2>Know what you’re getting.</h2><details><summary>What is free, and what is paid?</summary><p>Articles and browser-based creator tools are free. Books and bundles are paid digital products, with prices shown before checkout.</p></details><details><summary>How do delivery and refunds work?</summary><p>Books are delivered digitally through Lemon Squeezy after payment. Purchases include the existing 30-day money-back guarantee. Use the support details in your order receipt if you need help or want to request a refund.</p></details><details><summary>Is this the same Strategic Sloth library?</summary><p>Yes. The existing books and articles now live in Learn, the educational section of Strategic Sloth. Existing book, article, and checkout links are retained.</p></details><details><summary>Are the books a promise of income?</summary><p>No. They are educational resources. Results depend on your circumstances, work, and demand for what you make. Read the free material first to see whether the approach is useful to you.</p></details><details><summary>How should I use the international business material?</summary><p>Use it as background reading and a starting point for questions. Banking, tax, residency, and citizenship rules change. Check current official sources and consult a qualified professional before acting.</p></details></section>
</Layout>
